(6140307, 904295, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing [user] fotomann_forever[/user]? If so, welcome back!<br/> <br/>If not doesn''t matter as I love the shot (for more than just the obvious reasons).  Didn''t know the misquote until I looked it up - very biblical of you.  The lighting is excellent, so is the location and, of course, the model. Did you create the graffiti or was it a lucky find?<br/> <br/>Now, the critisms... oh crap, wife just got home - have to go to next shot<br/> <br/>9 by the way.</td>', 'I''m guessing [user] fotomann_forever[/user]? If so, welcome back! If not doesn''t matter as I love the shot (for more than just the obvious reasons).  Didn''t know the misquote until I looked it up - very biblical of you.  The lighting is excellent, so is the location and, of course, the model. Did you create the graffiti or was it a lucky find? Now, the critisms... oh crap, wife just got home - have to go to next shot 9 by the way.', '2010-08-25 03:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
