(6143058, 904701, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice symetry and good title.</td>', 'Nice symetry and good title.', '2010-08-27 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143073, 905094, 119417, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition. I love the reds in the wood floor, and the gauzy, ethereal feel to the light. I''m not 100% sure about the way the woman is lit--I wonder whether I might prefer it if she were a little darker or a little brighter. Maybe not, though. The PP is also a little heavy--I think it''s appropriate for a fine art shot, but I think I would prefer something more naturalistic for a wedding album.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition. I love the reds in the wood floor, and the gauzy, ethereal feel to the light. I''m not 100% sure about the way the woman is lit--I wonder whether I might prefer it if she were a little darker or a little brighter. Maybe not, though. The PP is also a little heavy--I think it''s appropriate for a fine art shot, but I think I would prefer something more naturalistic for a wedding album.', '2010-08-27 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143075, 905263, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in the foreground, but I''m having a little trouble figuring out what I''m looking at and how it relates to the title.</td>', 'I like the texture in the foreground, but I''m having a little trouble figuring out what I''m looking at and how it relates to the title.', '2010-08-27 18:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143077, 905329, 119417, '<td valign="top">The rose is nice, but I would prefer it if the DOF were shallower as the background is a little distracting, in my opinion. There''s also a lot of nice texture in the petals that I feel could be brought out more in PP.</td>', 'The rose is nice, but I would prefer it if the DOF were shallower as the background is a little distracting, in my opinion. There''s also a lot of nice texture in the petals that I feel could be brought out more in PP.', '2010-08-27 18:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143079, 904656, 119417, '<td valign="top">I tend to have trouble connecting with this sort of portrait, but it''s executed very well. The lighting is flattering and has that glamour quality without being overdone. PP is well done and not too heavy.<br/> <br/>Trying to deconstruct the lighting, it looks like maybe an on-axis ring light plus a soft fill from the right, and then maybe a background light. I wonder what it would look like with a separation light on her hair. Of course, I''m probably talking out of my behind at this point.</td>', 'I tend to have trouble connecting with this sort of portrait, but it''s executed very well. The lighting is flattering and has that glamour quality without being overdone. PP is well done and not too heavy. Trying to deconstruct the lighting, it looks like maybe an on-axis ring light plus a soft fill from the right, and then maybe a background light. I wonder what it would look like with a separation light on her hair. Of course, I''m probably talking out of my behind at this point.', '2010-08-27 18:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143083, 905411, 119417, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea and the image delivers on the quote well. I find the light not quite dramatic enough, plus I wish there were more than just the one color. Also, I don''t recognize the quote at all.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea and the image delivers on the quote well. I find the light not quite dramatic enough, plus I wish there were more than just the one color. Also, I don''t recognize the quote at all.', '2010-08-27 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143085, 905079, 119417, '<td valign="top">I feel like there''s a story here but I can''t really tell what it is. It''s a pretty good shot and I like the exposure, but I find myself wanting more from the story aspect.</td>', 'I feel like there''s a story here but I can''t really tell what it is. It''s a pretty good shot and I like the exposure, but I find myself wanting more from the story aspect.', '2010-08-27 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143088, 905167, 119417, '<td valign="top">The whole scene is a little too dark and would benefit from more dramatic lighting. The composition also seems a little weak, as there is no particular focal point and the fact that Half-Dome is facing out of the frame tends to lead the eye off the left edge. This might work better wider and would almost certainly look better longer, but as it is it''s a little bland.</td>', 'The whole scene is a little too dark and would benefit from more dramatic lighting. The composition also seems a little weak, as there is no particular focal point and the fact that Half-Dome is facing out of the frame tends to lead the eye off the left edge. This might work better wider and would almost certainly look better longer, but as it is it''s a little bland.', '2010-08-27 18:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143093, 905374, 119417, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model and I like the idea. I think a different crop would work better, as the area in her neck and shoulder don''t seem to add anything to the image. I also don''t understand the significance of the tear (or is it a rhinestone?) in the corner of her eye. The way the earring is in shadow also doesn''t work well for me, because it seems like if it''s in there, it should be doing something more.</td>', 'Very pretty model and I like the idea. I think a different crop would work better, as the area in her neck and shoulder don''t seem to add anything to the image. I also don''t understand the significance of the tear (or is it a rhinestone?) in the corner of her eye. The way the earring is in shadow also doesn''t work well for me, because it seems like if it''s in there, it should be doing something more.', '2010-08-27 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143094, 905138, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in the cake, but I feel like it needs to be staged a little better. The big drip of frosting on top of the middle layer detracts for me. It''s also a shame that the middle layer is set back a bit from the other two, because the DOF is softening that while the others are sharper. The lighting is very pleasant, though.</td>', 'Nice texture in the cake, but I feel like it needs to be staged a little better. The big drip of frosting on top of the middle layer detracts for me. It''s also a shame that the middle layer is set back a bit from the other two, because the DOF is softening that while the others are sharper. The lighting is very pleasant, though.', '2010-08-27 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143096, 905116, 119417, '<td valign="top">The main thing I would want different about this is for it to be sharper. There''s a lot of nice texture in the pieces, but I don''t feel it comes out enough.</td>', 'The main thing I would want different about this is for it to be sharper. There''s a lot of nice texture in the pieces, but I don''t feel it comes out enough.', '2010-08-27 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143100, 904701, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines. There needs to be something else, though, something to add humor or drama, something memorable. This could be the addition of a person or some kind of background to give context. Could also be a scene of some sort, say perhaps the escalator breaking, or a shot showing people walking up and down a stationary escalator.</td>', 'Nice leading lines. There needs to be something else, though, something to add humor or drama, something memorable. This could be the addition of a person or some kind of background to give context. Could also be a scene of some sort, say perhaps the escalator breaking, or a shot showing people walking up and down a stationary escalator.', '2010-08-27 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143104, 904726, 119417, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I like the composition a lot--nice layers and depth. I find myself wishing the foreground and sky were brighter, but even so it''s very pleasant.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I like the composition a lot--nice layers and depth. I find myself wishing the foreground and sky were brighter, but even so it''s very pleasant.', '2010-08-27 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143105, 905166, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, strong lines. The glow at the front of the column is particularly good. I''d like the sky to be a bit more dramatic.</td>', 'Nice composition, strong lines. The glow at the front of the column is particularly good. I''d like the sky to be a bit more dramatic.', '2010-08-27 19:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143108, 904295, 119417, '<td valign="top">This image is very well executed--great lighting, beautiful model, interesting location, good composition. However, I feel that the juxtaposition of the title and the image doesn''t work. You have this beautiful, graceful model, but the only way it meshes with the title is in the word "ass," which kind of cheapens it, I think.</td>', 'This image is very well executed--great lighting, beautiful model, interesting location, good composition. However, I feel that the juxtaposition of the title and the image doesn''t work. You have this beautiful, graceful model, but the only way it meshes with the title is in the word "ass," which kind of cheapens it, I think.', '2010-08-27 19:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143109, 904777, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. It seems a little underexposed to me, though, and I''d like more contrast.</td>', 'Nice scene. It seems a little underexposed to me, though, and I''d like more contrast.', '2010-08-27 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143112, 904539, 119417, '<td valign="top">The biggest thing here is that the lighting is too harsh. The shadows have very hard edges, and the highlights in the metal give it kind of a washed-out look. Some other considerations: The green of the machine doesn''t contrast enough with the blue of the sky--this isn''t something you can change, really, but it''s good to think about the color palette you''re working with. When possible, try to use complementary colors. The angle here is also not all that interesting--a lower angle would make the machine look bigger and more impressive. I think it would also help to see where the tires meet the ground. Finally, there''s a dust spot in the upper left corner that should be cloned out.</td>', 'The biggest thing here is that the lighting is too harsh. The shadows have very hard edges, and the highlights in the metal give it kind of a washed-out look. Some other considerations: The green of the machine doesn''t contrast enough with the blue of the sky--this isn''t something you can change, really, but it''s good to think about the color palette you''re working with. When possible, try to use complementary colors. The angle here is also not all that interesting--a lower angle would make the machine look bigger and more impressive. I think it would also help to see where the tires meet the ground. Finally, there''s a dust spot in the upper left corner that should be cloned out.', '2010-08-27 19:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143113, 905286, 119417, '<td valign="top">Ha! I love the way you executed the concept of the quote. Very, very clever. Lighting is pretty good and the overall composition works. Too bad the sky on the right isn''t less empty, but you work with what you''ve got. The light falloff in the corners helps alleviate that, too. Good job!</td>', 'Ha! I love the way you executed the concept of the quote. Very, very clever. Lighting is pretty good and the overall composition works. Too bad the sky on the right isn''t less empty, but you work with what you''ve got. The light falloff in the corners helps alleviate that, too. Good job!', '2010-08-27 19:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143116, 905336, 119417, '<td valign="top">Given the high-key effect you''re going for here, I think this would have worked better if the ground were also part of that invisible whiteness, to really isolate the cake, knife, and crumbs. Otherwise, pretty good.</td>', 'Given the high-key effect you''re going for here, I think this would have worked better if the ground were also part of that invisible whiteness, to really isolate the cake, knife, and crumbs. Otherwise, pretty good.', '2010-08-27 19:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143118, 905259, 119417, '<td valign="top">Not sure about this. The whole thing is a little too dim and soft to give much idea about why it''s important to see what''s in the image, but at the same time the basket is too recognizable for this to work as an abstract. I also don''t get what it has to do with the title.</td>', 'Not sure about this. The whole thing is a little too dim and soft to give much idea about why it''s important to see what''s in the image, but at the same time the basket is too recognizable for this to work as an abstract. I also don''t get what it has to do with the title.', '2010-08-27 19:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143119, 905317, 119417, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a technically perfect image, but I find it compelling all the same. I love the expression on her face, how it really communicates the feeling of frustration and determination. And I like the way her hands look purposeful. Technique-wise, I think her face should be lit better and the background should either be darker or blurred out with a wider aperture. So, well done on the subject and story, and keep at it with the technique.</td>', 'This isn''t a technically perfect image, but I find it compelling all the same. I love the expression on her face, how it really communicates the feeling of frustration and determination. And I like the way her hands look purposeful. Technique-wise, I think her face should be lit better and the background should either be darker or blurred out with a wider aperture. So, well done on the subject and story, and keep at it with the technique.', '2010-08-27 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143120, 904715, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic light, which does give it that creepy feel you''re going for. I feel like there should be another element in the photo to raise the stakes as far as the scene is concerned.</td>', 'Nice dramatic light, which does give it that creepy feel you''re going for. I feel like there should be another element in the photo to raise the stakes as far as the scene is concerned.', '2010-08-27 19:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143121, 904711, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, sharpness, and the use of black to frame the subjects. I don''t think it works well conceptually, though, because the image itself seems to speak more about dirtiness and the sort of animalistic sensuality connoted by it than it does about water.</td>', 'I like the lighting, sharpness, and the use of black to frame the subjects. I don''t think it works well conceptually, though, because the image itself seems to speak more about dirtiness and the sort of animalistic sensuality connoted by it than it does about water.', '2010-08-27 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143123, 905086, 119417, '<td valign="top">I like the rim lighting and the expression on her face. The aperture seems very well chosen to keep both her face and the cake relatively sharp while blurring her shoulders more. I think her face could be brighter, and the thing on the left (can''t tell if it''s a chair or maybe a low-hanging picture frame or what) shouldn''t be there.</td>', 'I like the rim lighting and the expression on her face. The aperture seems very well chosen to keep both her face and the cake relatively sharp while blurring her shoulders more. I think her face could be brighter, and the thing on the left (can''t tell if it''s a chair or maybe a low-hanging picture frame or what) shouldn''t be there.', '2010-08-27 19:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143126, 905178, 119417, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the shot itself is a little bland. Some other ideas to execute on the concept: actually looking into a giraffe''s open mouth, a wide-angle shot of a giraffe trying to lick the camera, etc. I know these aren''t easy shots to get, but the thing is that this shot could be any old snapshot from a trip to the zoo.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the shot itself is a little bland. Some other ideas to execute on the concept: actually looking into a giraffe''s open mouth, a wide-angle shot of a giraffe trying to lick the camera, etc. I know these aren''t easy shots to get, but the thing is that this shot could be any old snapshot from a trip to the zoo.', '2010-08-27 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143129, 905129, 119417, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great lighting, excellent composition. I wish the whisk were more in focus, but I know how hard these kinds of captures are. Very well done.</td>', 'Great concept, great lighting, excellent composition. I wish the whisk were more in focus, but I know how hard these kinds of captures are. Very well done.', '2010-08-27 19:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143130, 904703, 119417, '<td valign="top">The image itself is just about flawless, as far as I can see, and I like the way the juxtaposition with the title produces the feeling of a knowing grin. Well done.</td>', 'The image itself is just about flawless, as far as I can see, and I like the way the juxtaposition with the title produces the feeling of a knowing grin. Well done.', '2010-08-27 19:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143131, 905357, 119417, '<td valign="top">Ha! Love the concept. I tend to prefer B&amp;W shots to be higher contrast, but you made me grin, so that''s a job well done.</td>', 'Ha! Love the concept. I tend to prefer B&W shots to be higher contrast, but you made me grin, so that''s a job well done.', '2010-08-27 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143132, 904461, 119417, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, good use of DOF, and I like the simplicity of the color scheme.</td>', 'Strong lines, good use of DOF, and I like the simplicity of the color scheme.', '2010-08-27 19:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143133, 904854, 119417, '<td valign="top">Oh, very well done. The exposure is spot on for achieving that foreboding feeling, and the storytelling achieved with the combination of image and title is excellent. Great texture in the smokestacks, too. Very, very good.</td>', 'Oh, very well done. The exposure is spot on for achieving that foreboding feeling, and the storytelling achieved with the combination of image and title is excellent. Great texture in the smokestacks, too. Very, very good.', '2010-08-27 19:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143295, 905357, 116640, '<td valign="top">This is great!! I know I certainly thought he was singing douche for many years.</td>', 'This is great!! I know I certainly thought he was singing douche for many years.', '2010-08-28 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143306, 904715, 104518, '<td valign="top">Is something that has been misquoted for centuries still a misquote? When does it take on a life of its own? But I did like the pic.</td>', 'Is something that has been misquoted for centuries still a misquote? When does it take on a life of its own? But I did like the pic.', '2010-08-28 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143308, 904726, 104518, '<td valign="top">Kept looking for the still in the woods. Maybe it was right in front of me.</td>', 'Kept looking for the still in the woods. Maybe it was right in front of me.', '2010-08-28 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143309, 905129, 104518, '<td valign="top">My ignorance; this is a misquote of what?</td>', 'My ignorance; this is a misquote of what?', '2010-08-28 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143311, 905356, 104518, '<td valign="top">So are Pre Bills OK? Nice find.</td>', 'So are Pre Bills OK? Nice find.', '2010-08-28 01:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143312, 905374, 104518, '<td valign="top">This certainly is a misquote, and you''ve added a twist, or maybe sprinkled a twist.</td>', 'This certainly is a misquote, and you''ve added a twist, or maybe sprinkled a twist.', '2010-08-28 01:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143315, 904703, 104518, '<td valign="top">Everybody knows it should be, "Well, here''s another nice dress you''ve gotten me into"</td>', 'Everybody knows it should be, "Well, here''s another nice dress you''ve gotten me into"', '2010-08-28 01:49:52.000000', NULL, 1);
