(6148376, 905356, 13688, '<td valign="top">Thanks all.  The world is a strange place, though not perfect.  If it was a perfect place, the guys would have been closer together and the street wouldn''t have suddenly gotten busy as they walked through the scene.  ...Oh and more people like yourselves would get my sense of humor ;)...Oh and they would have been buffalo bills supporters...but it''s too far away to tell anyway...so let''s just pretend they are ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-18 14:04:18.</i></td>', 'Thanks all.  The world is a strange place, though not perfect.  If it was a perfect place, the guys would have been closer together and the street wouldn''t have suddenly gotten busy as they walked through the scene.  ...Oh and more people like yourselves would get my sense of humor ;)...Oh and they would have been buffalo bills supporters...but it''s too far away to tell anyway...so let''s just pretend they are ;)', '2010-09-01 11:56:43.000000', '2010-12-18 14:04:18.000000', 0),
