(6627128, 905263, 93565, '<td valign="top">I knew right away what this was when I saw it (or, at least, I knew what the wing was and quickly deduced the larger subject). I didn''t vote, but this really is an awesome shot. The relevance to the quote is perfect, but the silhouette of the head with crossed legs is pretty haunting (quite reminiscent of Alfred Hitchcock). Very cool- fav for sure.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-12-28 20:37:28.</i></td>', 'I knew right away what this was when I saw it (or, at least, I knew what the wing was and quickly deduced the larger subject). I didn''t vote, but this really is an awesome shot. The relevance to the quote is perfect, but the silhouette of the head with crossed legs is pretty haunting (quite reminiscent of Alfred Hitchcock). Very cool- fav for sure.', '2011-12-28 16:41:58.000000', '2011-12-28 20:37:28.000000', 0);
